sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Driver as Conductor
    participant App as Aplicación ParkLink
    participant Agent as Agente conversacional
    participant Discovery as Parking Discovery
    participant Broker as Command Broker
    participant Reservation as Reservation Management
    participant Payment as Payment
    participant Notification as Notification

    Driver->>App: Expresa destino, fecha y duración
    App->>Agent: Envía solicitud autenticada
    Agent->>Discovery: Consulta opciones disponibles
    Discovery-->>Agent: Devuelve opciones, precios y horarios
    Agent-->>App: Presenta alternativas
    Driver->>App: Selecciona un espacio
    Agent->>Broker: Publica HoldReservation
    Broker->>Reservation: Entrega comando durable
    Reservation-->>Agent: Publica ReservationHeld
    Agent-->>App: Muestra precio y condiciones
    Driver->>App: Confirma explícitamente
    Agent->>Broker: Publica ConfirmReservation
    Broker->>Reservation: Entrega comando idempotente
    Reservation->>Payment: Solicita autorización mediante saga
    Payment-->>Reservation: PaymentAuthorized
    Reservation-->>Notification: Publica ReservationConfirmed
    Notification-->>Driver: Envía código y detalle de reserva

    Note over Agent,Reservation: El agente conversa, pero Reservation decide.
    Note over Broker,Reservation: La cola ordena la entrega y no sustituye las reglas del dominio.
